sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor ATC as ATC Controller
    participant GUI as SchedulingView (GUI)
    participant Svc as ApplicationService
    participant Sched as Scheduler
    participant RQ as ReadyQueue
    participant Res as ResourceManager (std::mutex)
    participant DB as MySQL (InnoDB)

    ATC->>GUI: Click "Schedule & Allocate Next"
    GUI->>Svc: scheduleAndAllocateNext()
    activate Svc

    Svc->>Sched: selectNextProcess()
    activate Sched
    Sched->>RQ: Scan lowest effectivePriority ASC (1=Highest), arrivalTime ASC
    RQ-->>Sched: Candidate Process (e.g., Flight 101, Priority 3)
    Sched-->>Svc: Candidate Process selected
    deactivate Sched

    Svc->>Svc: findCompatibleAvailableRunway(Flight 101)
    Svc-->>Svc: Runway 1 ('09L', Type: Both) Available

    Svc->>Sched: dispatchNextProcess()
    activate Sched
    Sched->>RQ: dequeue candidate
    Sched-->>Svc: Process transitioned to Running
    deactivate Sched

    Svc->>Svc: allocateRunway(Runway 1, Flight 101)
    activate Svc
    Svc->>Res: ScopedResourceLock lock(m_resourceMutex)
    activate Res
    Note over Res: Critical Section Protected by std::mutex

    Svc->>DB: db.transaction() (START TRANSACTION)
    
    Svc->>DB: SELECT status FROM runways WHERE runway_id = 1 FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>Svc: status = 'Available'
    Svc->>DB: SELECT assignment_id FROM runway_assignments WHERE runway_id = 1 AND status = 'Active' FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>Svc: 0 rows (No active assignment)
    Svc->>DB: SELECT operational_status FROM flights WHERE flight_id = 101 FOR UPDATE
    DB-->>Svc: status = 'Scheduled' (Eligible)

    Svc->>DB: INSERT INTO runway_assignments (flight_id, runway_id, status) VALUES (101, 1, 'Active')
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE runways SET status = 'Occupied' WHERE runway_id = 1
    Svc->>DB: UPDATE flights SET operational_status = 'Cleared' WHERE flight_id = 101
    Svc->>DB: INSERT INTO operation_logs (..., 'RUNWAY_ASSIGN', 'Committed', ...)

    Svc->>DB: db.commit()
    DB-->>Svc: Transaction Committed

    Svc->>Res: confirmAllocationUnlocked(Runway 1, Flight 101)
    deactivate Res
    Note over Res: Mutex Released, In-Memory Runway Marked Occupied
    deactivate Svc

    Svc-->>GUI: ScheduleAndAllocateResult (Success)
    deactivate Svc
    GUI->>ATC: Render Updated Queue and Runway Allocation
